window.RCC_CHANGELOG = [{"version":"3.6.1","date":"2026-11-08","items":["Practice is tidier: the sheet header is two clean rows, the trainer and backing cards fold away (closed by default on phones), the chord diagram is bigger.","Phones: one-row header with a Find button instead of a second search bar; six tuner pegs fit in one row; the active overlay chip is readable again.","Record: the controls sit under the picture instead of on top of the chord overlay."]},{"version":"3.6.0","date":"2026-11-08","items":["**Menus instead of a scroll**: four groups (Play, Learn, Studio, More). Labelled sections on desktop; a four-tab bar with a slide-up menu on phones.","**Accounts on phones and the web** work now: sign in or register on the device, keep a library per account, and cloud sync through the helper server.","**Find**: a Solos filter that searches guitar solos as tab and opens them in Solo mode; paste a Spotify, Apple Music or YouTube link and it becomes a song search; Android share sheet into the app.","**Phones**: Ultimate Guitar is fetched natively first and falls back to the helper server automatically.","**Solo**: gems grow as they approach, bends pull the gem up and release it, slides send a ghost gem travelling to the target fret, hits burst, the active string glows, vibrato moves.","**\"Hear it\" sounds like a guitar**: plucked-string synthesis replaces the organ-like tones for chords and notes everywhere.","**Tuner**: ignores the pick attack, steadier needle that still follows real moves, a lock flash and a vibration when a string lands in tune.","**New logo**: a pick with a chord grid, same red as the site, on every platform.","Pro dialogs show three features and fold the rest; smoother view, dialog and button motion."]},{"version":"3.5.0","date":"2026-11-02","items":["**Slow-downer** in Gear: load any recording, slow it to half speed at the same pitch, loop a lick between A and B, count it in from the Practice tempo, and hand the file to Chords from a recording. (Pro)","**Songwriter** in Learn → Write: pick a key, tap the chords that fit (the likely next ones glow), start from ten classic shapes, build verse/chorus/bridge, hear it with the backing band, open in Practice, save, or export a backing WAV. Capo hints when the shapes are hard. (play / save / export are Pro)","Two new Pro features show in the trial and upsell lists."]},{"version":"3.4.0","date":"2026-10-27","items":["**Practice plan**: the Plan button builds a short routine for the loaded song — tune up, learn the chords you haven't marked known, drill the hardest change, loop the busiest section at 70% with the tempo ramp, then play it through. (Pro)","**Lesson paths** in Learn: \"Your first 10 songs\" (free), Barre chords, Fingerstyle foundations, Lead guitar, Theory you actually use. Ticks come from what you do in the app.","**Chords from a recording**: pick an MP3/WAV in Find and get a timed chord sheet, on the device, no upload. (Pro)","**Stage mode**: full-screen chord sheet in big type, pedal page turns (Page Down / →), next song at the end. (Pro)","**Backing band**: four new styles (Pop, Country, Reggae, Half-time), keys under the ballad styles, fills before section changes, walking bass into the next chord, and **Export WAV** for any song. (export is Pro)","**Weekly report** in Learn → Progress, with \"Email it to me\" through the helper server.","**What's new** dialog after an update, and this changelog on the website.","Pro trial is tied to your email on the helper server, so clearing the app doesn't restart it.","Looper shows which capture path it is using (audio thread or fallback) so drift is explainable.","Helper server: Square webhook issues keys automatically, trial endpoint, weekly-report mail, owner export for backups."]},{"version":"3.3.1","date":"2026-10-26","items":["Helper server address comes from 506clicks.ca automatically; phones and the web app need no setup.","Content-Security-Policy allows the helper server, so Ultimate Guitar search works in the web and phone builds."]},{"version":"3.3.0","date":"2026-10-25","items":["ChordClicks Pro: scored solos, trainer, neck (arpeggios, triads, CAGED), looper, stream tools, unlimited library, fingerpicking patterns, sync. 7-day trial, keys verified offline.","Ultimate Guitar on web and phone through a helper server.","Library multi-select with bulk playlist/genre/delete.","Welcome tour and a startup message for the free tier."]},{"version":"3.2.0","date":"2026-10-24","items":["New look: paper, ink and red, condensed display type, hairlines instead of gradients.","iPhone: camera and microphone opened in one capture, so recording really records.","Tuner: decimated YIN with octave check and string hysteresis; lighter on phones.","Record mode: countdown, trim, save to camera roll."]}];
